Package: corestats
Type: Package
Title: Core Stats for Introductory Statistics Courses
Version: 0.0.0
Author: Alberto Alvarez-Iglesias
Maintainer: Alberto Alvarez-Iglesias <alberto.alvarez-iglesias@universityofgalway.ie>
Description: This module provides essential, easy-to-use statistical and graphical
  analyses commonly used in introductory biostatistics and public health
  courses. Tools include functions for data exploration, such as
  customizable bar charts, summary tables, and other core descriptive and
  inferential statistics.
